# Emergency braking (docs/emergency_stop.md) on the burn-in axis (10 mm a
# revolution): at 188 rad/s (300 mm/s) something fails; hv0.sim_dist,
# zeroed then, is how far the axis went (1 rad = 1.59 mm). Coasting takes
# ~16 rad (26 mm) and ~180 ms.
# estop_link.test with the stops off (cmd_stop = 0, en_stop = 0): the
# behaviour before docs/emergency_stop.md, outputs off at once and the axis
# coasting on friction.
@args --drive ../hwtest/burnin/ECMA-C30604FS/stmbl.conf
@timeout 120
fault0.cmd_stop = 0
fault0.en_stop = 0
lcnc 0 0
run 0.5
lcnc 1 0
run 1.5
lcnc 1 300
run 1
hv0.sim_vel
hv0.sim_dist = 0
lcncstop
run 0.008
fault0.stop
run 0.3
hv0.sim_dist
@expect fault0.stop[1] == 0
@expect hv0.sim_dist > 14
